This is a collection of example plugins for Cantemo Portal, intended for educational purposes.

Use the install.sh script for installing the plugin. It will install it into /opt/cantemo/portal/portal/plugins/PortalPluginTemplate

Update 2025-11-18: Some of the functionality in these examples are deprecated. Still valid in Cantemo 6:
* Dashboard widgets
* Menu items (`templates/portalplugintemplate/navigation_admin.html` etc)

Deprecated:
* Video player options
* The views are implemented with an old base class `ClassView`
* Database migrations not included and not picked up by modern Cantemo
